      "html": "<p>ATAK comprises of tools and plugins. Tools are included in ATAK and are the basis of everything that is done inside ATAK. Plugins are additions on top of the included tools.</p>\n<h3 id=\"basic-tools\"><a href=\"#basic-tools\">Basic tools:</a></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/doc/a1ae2d75-dc23-443b-aa26-526a47a1c85f\">Bloodhound tool</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/doc/c6ae417f-9cb1-47cd-b53e-dff9db30e24d\">Contacts / GeoChat tool</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/doc/8fe83d8c-29e4-44aa-9f59-6c72157323a1\">Point Dropper tool</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/doc/9417e4e1-0870-4938-8190-9b6ab0fd6734\">Toolbar tool</a></p>\n<h3 id=\"plugins\"><a href=\"#plugins\">Plugins:</a></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/doc/7b0492b3-42b0-46d2-b2a9-ade55453f2f4\">Data Sync -plugin</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/doc/c5fbff8c-3df8-43b8-81e4-7b6275409ac9\">UAS Tool -plugin</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/doc/c4818ab9-c30b-4a81-8abf-741761387f78\">VNS -plugin</a></p>\n<p>\\</p>"
